    "name": "Pizza Simulator Together",
    "steam_appid": 3319230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/de9fcc3caf37c3fca258370b13aa9767.avif?t=1731358977\" width=600 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza Simulator</strong> is a cooperative multiplayer pizzeria simulator where each player gets to experience managing their own restaurant. Oversee every aspect of running a pizzeria: set up the kitchen with modern equipment, hire and train staff, prepare a variety of dishes, serve customers, and handle payments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/2ff4d5ef21c69964456db8de577dcbe9.poster.avif?t=1731358977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/2ff4d5ef21c69964456db8de577dcbe9.webm?t=1731358977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/2ff4d5ef21c69964456db8de577dcbe9.mp4?t=1731358977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Goal</strong> \u2013 Create a perfectly functioning establishment where everything runs smoothly, and the reputation continually rises. Keep an eye on your pizzeria's rating and condition, competing for customer attention and maintaining your standing in a competitive environment. Expand your delivery fleet and ensure timely delivery of orders. Additionally, maintain order in the dining area, preventing unscrupulous guests from leaving without paying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or invite friends to develop the business together and succeed in the challenging world of the restaurant industry!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE DELICIOUS PIZZA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to each ingredient \u2013 your goal is to win over the hearts (and appetites) of all your customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/58aea01b0bac7fa70cc91dcf0133b43a.poster.avif?t=1731358977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/58aea01b0bac7fa70cc91dcf0133b43a.webm?t=1731358977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/58aea01b0bac7fa70cc91dcf0133b43a.mp4?t=1731358977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the experience alone or with friends. Invite them to help you grow and decorate your pizzeria!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE A UNIQUE INTERIOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange furniture and kitchen equipment to your taste, organize convenient storage for ingredients, and keep the dining area clean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DELIVER PIZZA STRAIGHT TO CUSTOMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop a delivery fleet and hire couriers to get your pizza to every doorstep.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/de9fcc3caf37c3fca258370b13aa9767.avif?t=1731358977\" width=600 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza Simulator</strong> is a cooperative multiplayer pizzeria simulator where each player gets to experience managing their own restaurant. Oversee every aspect of running a pizzeria: set up the kitchen with modern equipment, hire and train staff, prepare a variety of dishes, serve customers, and handle payments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/2ff4d5ef21c69964456db8de577dcbe9.poster.avif?t=1731358977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/2ff4d5ef21c69964456db8de577dcbe9.webm?t=1731358977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/2ff4d5ef21c69964456db8de577dcbe9.mp4?t=1731358977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Goal</strong> \u2013 Create a perfectly functioning establishment where everything runs smoothly, and the reputation continually rises. Keep an eye on your pizzeria's rating and condition, competing for customer attention and maintaining your standing in a competitive environment. Expand your delivery fleet and ensure timely delivery of orders. Additionally, maintain order in the dining area, preventing unscrupulous guests from leaving without paying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or invite friends to develop the business together and succeed in the challenging world of the restaurant industry!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE DELICIOUS PIZZA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to each ingredient \u2013 your goal is to win over the hearts (and appetites) of all your customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/58aea01b0bac7fa70cc91dcf0133b43a.poster.avif?t=1731358977\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/58aea01b0bac7fa70cc91dcf0133b43a.webm?t=1731358977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319230/extras/58aea01b0bac7fa70cc91dcf0133b43a.mp4?t=1731358977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the experience alone or with friends. Invite them to help you grow and decorate your pizzeria!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE A UNIQUE INTERIOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange furniture and kitchen equipment to your taste, organize convenient storage for ingredients, and keep the dining area clean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DELIVER PIZZA STRAIGHT TO CUSTOMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop a delivery fleet and hire couriers to get your pizza to every doorstep.</p>",
    "short_description": "Pizza Simulator is a cooperative simulator where you manage a pizzeria, set up the kitchen, hire staff, prepare and deliver orders, and maintain the reputation and cleanliness of your establishment. Create your dream pizzeria!",
